    <body>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service"><source>SimpleCMP service</source><target>SimpleCMP-Dienst</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.service_id"><source>Service ID (slug)</source><target>Dienst-ID (Slug)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.service_id.description"><source>Stable kebab-case identifier, e.g. "google-analytics". Lower-case, no spaces.</source><target>Stabiler Kebab-Case-Bezeichner, z. B. "google-analytics". Kleinbuchstaben, keine Leerzeichen.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.name"><source>Display name</source><target>Anzeigename</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor"><source>Vendor</source><target>Anbieter</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor_country"><source>Vendor country (ISO 3166)</source><target>Anbieterland (ISO 3166)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor_address"><source>Vendor postal address</source><target>Anbieter-Postanschrift</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor_address.description"><source>Full postal address of the legal entity (e.g. "Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland"). Surfaced in the L2 Provider-Informationen modal.</source><target>Vollständige Postanschrift der juristischen Person (z.B. „Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland"). Wird im L2-Provider-Informationen-Modal angezeigt.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor_opt_out_url"><source>Vendor opt-out URL</source><target>Anbieter-Opt-Out-URL</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor_opt_out_url.description"><source>Service-specific opt-out endpoint (HTTPS). Distinct from the privacy-policy URL.</source><target>Service-spezifischer Opt-Out-Endpunkt (HTTPS). Unterscheidet sich von der Datenschutzerklärungs-URL.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor_partner"><source>Vendor partner / joint controllers</source><target>Anbieter-Partner / gemeinsam Verantwortliche</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor_partner.description"><source>Free-text disclosure of joint controllers, parent companies, or data-sharing partners (Fashion ID / Art. 26 GDPR), plus transfer-basis text (DPF / SCCs / Art. 49).</source><target>Freitext-Offenlegung gemeinsam Verantwortlicher, Konzernmütter oder Daten-Partner (Fashion ID / Art. 26 DSGVO), zuzüglich Transfer-Grundlagen-Text (DPF / SCCs / Art. 49).</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor_description"><source>Vendor description</source><target>Anbieter-Beschreibung</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.vendor_description.description"><source>Short description of the legal entity / company itself. Distinct from the service description (which describes the service).</source><target>Kurzbeschreibung der juristischen Person / des Unternehmens selbst. Unterscheidet sich von der Service-Beschreibung (die den Dienst beschreibt).</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.purposes"><source>Purposes</source><target>Zwecke</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.purposes.description"><source>What this service is used for. Choices come from the bundled tracker library and grow as new categories appear in it.</source><target>Wofür dieser Dienst genutzt wird. Die Auswahl stammt aus der mitgelieferten Tracker-Bibliothek und wächst, wenn dort neue Kategorien auftauchen.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.purposes.item.advertising"><source>Advertising</source><target>Werbung</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.purposes.item.analytics"><source>Analytics</source><target>Analyse</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.purposes.item.functional"><source>Functional</source><target>Funktional</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.purposes.item.marketing"><source>Marketing</source><target>Marketing</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.purposes.item.personalization"><source>Personalization</source><target>Personalisierung</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.purposes.item.security"><source>Security</source><target>Sicherheit</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.privacy_policy_url"><source>Privacy policy URL</source><target>Datenschutz-URL</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.description"><source>Description</source><target>Beschreibung</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.retention"><source>Retention (JSON)</source><target>Speicherdauer (JSON)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.i18n"><source>Translations (JSON)</source><target>Übersetzungen (JSON)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.cookies"><source>Cookie matchers (JSON array)</source><target>Cookie-Muster (JSON-Array)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.cookies.description"><source>Strings (exact match) or /regex/ (slash-bounded), e.g. ["_ga", "/^_ga_/", "_gid"].</source><target>Strings (exakt) oder /regex/ (Slash-begrenzt), z. B. ["_ga", "/^_ga_/", "_gid"].</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.origins"><source>Origin matchers (JSON array)</source><target>Origin-Muster (JSON-Array)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.origins.description"><source>Host strings or wildcards, e.g. ["www.google-analytics.com", "*.doubleclick.net"].</source><target>Host-Strings oder Wildcards, z. B. ["www.google-analytics.com", "*.doubleclick.net"].</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.extensions"><source>Extensions (JSON)</source><target>Erweiterungen (JSON)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.palette.protocol"><source>Protocol contract</source><target>Protokoll-Vertrag</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.palette.classification"><source>Classification (cookies + origins)</source><target>Klassifizierung (Cookies + Origins)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.palette.metadata"><source>Metadata</source><target>Metadaten</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.orphanCallout.title"><source>This service is no longer in the bundled library</source><target>Dieser Dienst ist nicht mehr in der Bibliothek</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_t3simplecmp_service.orphanCallout.body"><source>You adopted this service from the bundled simplecmp/services-library on %s. A later library release removed or renamed it, so this row is no longer library-backed. The service still works in your banner — you can keep editing it as a custom entry, search the Library tab for a possible replacement, or delete it from the Services tab if it's truly obsolete.</source><target>Sie haben diesen Dienst am %s aus der mitgelieferten simplecmp/services-library übernommen. Eine spätere Bibliotheksversion hat ihn entfernt oder umbenannt; dieser Eintrag wird nicht mehr von der Bibliothek getragen. Der Dienst funktioniert weiterhin im Banner — Sie können ihn als eigenen Eintrag weiter bearbeiten, im Bibliothek-Tab nach einem möglichen Ersatz suchen oder ihn im Dienste-Tab löschen, falls er endgültig nicht mehr benötigt wird.</target></trans-unit>

